- Yeah.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:07.860
Yeah.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:10.610
I used to be 114.

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:13.080
Now I'm 126.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.260
Since I met you. Yeah.

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:18.160
'Cause I went to the
doctor, 'cause I got COPD.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:21.583
And when I did that Corona
thing, they said, it's an area.

00:06:21.583 --> 00:06:24.130
They didn't know if I had it or not.

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:26.540
So I had to go to the real hospital

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:27.970
