00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.110
- [Mark] No, you seem great.

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:30.220
- Yeah.

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:32.600
- [Mark] Excellent, Rita.
So nice seeing you again.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:35.120
- Yeah. And without asking for money.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.410
Cause you made me feel bad now.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:38.830
I want to be like Jeff.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.040
- [Mark] Everybody asks me for money.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.190
- Yeah. But without money.

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:43.810
Just to be--

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:47.010
Come dressed up like Titi now, man.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.120
You helped me get--

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:50.310
I know my sister now and showed my sister

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:52.157
I'm a star now on real TV.

00:06:52.157 --> 00:06:52.990
(Mark laughs)

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:54.244
- [Mark] You are.

00:06:54.244 --> 00:06:57.010
Ha! And that means a star
because of this YouTube, right?

00:06:57.010 --> 00:06:57.930
- [Mark] You are a star!

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.267
- [Rita] Yeah. Thank you.

00:06:59.267 --> 00:07:00.180
- [Mark] We're going to make you famous.

00:07:00.180 --> 00:07:01.013
- [Rita] Yeah. Yeah.

00:07:01.013 --> 00:07:04.140
'Cause my sister said that
she's happy for me now.

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:04.973
- [Mark] Just gotta get you a manager now.

00:07:04.973 --> 00:07:06.430
- She got to see for yourself.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:08.010
Yeah. It ain't just money.

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:10.880
I just want my sister
to see I'm--you know--

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.930
be clean and pretty.

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:14.224
Yeah.
- Cool!

00:07:14.224 --> 00:07:15.057
- Yeah.

00:07:15.057 --> 00:07:15.890
- [Mark] You wanna dance for me?

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:17.706
- Yeah. You don't got no music.

00:07:17.706 --> 00:07:19.975
- [Mark] I don't have any
music, I'm sorry. Next time.

00:07:19.975 --> 00:07:23.640
- [Rita] But my sister works
for Sacramento Elementary,

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:26.120
and she's a minister.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:28.340
And she got a drill team

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:29.957
