some stuff, too, back home.

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:36.270
TV and the phone and stuff.

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:37.103
- [Mark] Oh, fun.

00:07:37.103 --> 00:07:39.540
- [Rita] Yeah. She's gonna
get me in a little while.

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:40.748
I just started visiting.

00:07:40.748 --> 00:07:41.581
- [Mark] There you go.

00:07:41.581 --> 00:07:42.414
- [Rita] Okay.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.121
- [Mark] Thank you very much.

00:07:44.121 --> 00:07:45.049
